So it takes him an hour to get to work.

212
00:12:28,070 --> 00:12:29,480
What are we thinking?

213
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:34,220
Yes, we're thinking. He can't live near office.

214
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:35,540
No way

215
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:39,440
he lives near the office, it's impossible, because it takes him an hour.

216
