The whole hour to get to work.

217
00:12:42,650 --> 00:12:43,220
Good.

218
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:46,490
She's very practical when it comes to presents.

219
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:51,090
She's very practical when it comes to presents.

220
00:12:51,090 --> 00:12:52,470
What are we thinking?

221
00:12:59,910 --> 00:13:00,510
Okay.

222
00:13:00,870 --> 00:13:01,260
All right.

223
00:13:01,260 --> 00:13:06,810
We might think She might not like it if I bring her flowers.

224
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:12,150
She might not like it, okay, because she's very practical, we know it.

225
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:16,850
But on the other hand, we are not so sure about it.

226
